# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# F-IMG-SHIP5 per-size routing gate. A size other than OXI_SIZES runs on oxi only when
# `image_size_gate.py judge` wrote a PASS record for exactly that width x height, made with the very
# oxi binary Studio would run (sha256) and the arithmetic Studio passes (chunks / attention
# precision / VAE conv, when the record names them). No record, a FAIL, another binary, other
# arithmetic or an unreadable record keep the sd.cpp route. Records live in a sibling of
# engine.json: <config dir>/oxi-size-gates/<W>x<H>.json. Shipping this code enables no size.
